WEBVTT

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:11.530
<b>It is said that there is a legendary diver in the seas of Izu known as the Jet-Black Mermaid.</b>

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:18.670
<b>Wearing a completely black wetsuit even in the dead of winter, it swims at superhuman speed. {## will maintain nonhuman assumption}</b>

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:26.650
<b>Whenever divers run into trouble beneath the surface, it appears as if out of thin water to rescue them. {## thin water...}</b>

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:33.100
<b>And if you are able to befriend it, you'll be invited to the hidden Dragon Palace. {## 'undiscovered', well..., sort of suggests it should be or will be/ alt. secret, there are a lot of options}</b>

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.350
<b>Or so the rumors say.</b>

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.210
<b>The Jet-Black Mermaid?!</b>

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.230
<b>It must be really pretty!</b>

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.120
<b>Ugh, that sounds super creepy.</b>

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.940
<b>Does it even exist?</b>

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.820
<b>Like I said, it's just a rumor.</b>

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.440
<b>But if it was real, I'd love to meet it! {## were}</b>

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.040
<b>Yeah, and go to the Dragon Palace too.</b>

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.830
<b>I want to see the flounders and sea breams dance! {## extremely minor, but I like having compounds at the end to limit unwanted distribution}</b>

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:02.720
<b>Hang on, this is all way too suspicious!</b>

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:05.580
<b>There's no guarantee it's even human.</b>

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.150
<b>What if it's a sea monster?</b>

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:09.710
<b>Or a fishman.</b>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:10.920
<b>Or a kappa. {## grey face no space}</b>

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.780
<b>Don't those live in rivers?</b>

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:16.880
<b>I'm fine going anywhere I might find wonders.</b>

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.140
<b>Teko...</b>

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:22.620
<b>I'm still afraid of diving at night, 
but during the day should be okay. {## I'm trying to dodge fine, but both 'alright' and 'OK' end up rhyming}</b>

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:28.830
<b>And after I get my Advanced certification, I want to try going deeper than eighteen meters!</b>

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:30.980
<b>Teko!</b>

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:32.030
<b>Pikari!</b>

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:34.490
<b>You're a different Teko than usual today!</b>

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:38.240
<b>Indeed! For today, I'm in max motivation mode!</b>

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:41.390
<b>I get the feeling we might even get to meet a mermaid!</b>

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.700
<b>I'm ready for anything!</b>

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.930
<b>Okay, okay, that's enough about mermaids.</b>

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:48.400
<b>Let's get ready.</b>

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.620
<b>Okay.</b>

